          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Talchar",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:modify_unit",
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Talchar%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
            id: "Talchar",
            object: "%7B%22id%22%3A%22%22%2C%22effects%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22abilities%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 150,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Galdrad",
            text: _("Halt! Who enters our sacred vale without leave?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Galdrad",
            text: _("Choose your words wisely, bandits. Speak, knowing that the penalty for trespassing on our lands is death."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("I—"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ethiliel",
            text: _("This is no bandit, for these humans bear the banner of the South Guard, not those rags of the Urzas. Though it remains to be seen whether this proves an improvement — why do you enter the hallowed isle of Elrath?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("To—"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Vaenuith",
            text: _("To ask our help, no doubt. There is darkness in the air, corruption in the earth. Someone has been meddling in the black magic. Let us not forget that it is you humans who first brought this perverse sorcery to our great continent, when you arrived here centuries ago."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("I—"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Talchar",
            text: _("The past has shown that your race cannot be trusted. A human untrained in the mystic arts is much more likely to be corrupted by such a force than to have the knowledge or ability to banish it."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("But—"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Vaenuith",
            text: _("Why should we treat with you now, when it is your kind’s inaction that has allowed this blight to grow unchecked? Begone with you, mayfly, and leave to us our peace."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            portrait: "portraits/deoran-mad.webp",
            text: _("—but, but, I have scarcely been here a month! I could not have acted on something that began before my arrival! And besides, this is not the fault of “my kind” but of the Urza brothe—"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            portrait: "misc/blank-hex.png",
            text: _("(deep breath)"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 1000,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("...honorable elves, I am Commander Deoran, of Westin’s South Guard. I cannot speak for the past, but in the present we need your help."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("Our farms and villages are plundered by criminals, casting dark spells and defiling the dead. We learned that this vale is a place of importance to them, and came seeking answers."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("Whence did our foes learn their grim power? How do we find the source of this spreading corruption, so that we may destroy it? Good elves of the vale, can you not aid us in our plight?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ithelden",
            text: _("..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ithelden",
            text: _("...very well, outlander. The challenge is passed. Enter, and greet us as we are in life."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_sound",
            file: "skill-illusion-quiet.wav",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
