          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Guuuhhh..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("What manner of undeath have you inflicted upon this poor elf! This is even worse than the walking corpses we’ve already fought, if such a thing is possible."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Urza Nalmath",
            text: _("Undeath!? You offend me, good sir — this lovely lady is still alive... although come to think of it, she might wish she weren’t. Such a supple body; such an alluring voice. Isn’t she charming?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Graaahhh..."),
